---
{
  title: "objective"
}
---
### NAME

    objective() - Gets the objective pronoun for a gender.

### SYNOPSIS

    string objective( mixed ob );

### DESCRIPTION

    Gets the objective pronoun for a gender.

### RETURN VALUES

    (string) Objective pronoun (him/her/it/them)

### EXAMPLE

    {{di1}}objective("female");  // Returns "her"{{di0}}
